{
  "id": "REV.9",
  "number": "9",
  "bookId": "REV",
  "reference": "Akis. 9",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "REV 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Arupepe ŋina a ŋakan",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu emalaika ŋolo a ŋikan tokutak arupepe keŋ. Oanyuwa etop ŋolo kebu kimasun anakuj kwap, ainakinitae etop ŋol ekipuŋguwo ŋolo ŋaaret auwuat ŋina aoyan ŋina nyesalunit alokwap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu etop toŋaa auwuat ŋina aoyan ŋin, tolomu apuru ŋina ekoni ŋina ka arira a ŋina apolon nooi, kisiryon apuru akoloŋ ka kidiama cuc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolomu emaase anapuru a ŋin bu kwap, aponi inakinae emaase agogoŋu ŋina ikoni ŋina eyakatar ŋikiitwania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi tolimokinae ikes nyewan ŋinya kori ŋikito kori ŋinibore erupunit alokwap daadaŋ; nai mati ŋituŋa daadaŋ ŋulu emam emacar ŋolo ka Akuj aloreetin kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pa acamakinitae emaase ŋol akiar ŋituŋa ŋul, nai akisican ikes ŋilapyo ŋikan. Apipilu ŋina ka akisicanet a ŋin, ikoni ŋina ikipesyo ekiitwan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alolapyo a ŋulukan a ŋul, iwarete ŋituŋa atwakare, nai nyeryamunete; iwarete epite ŋolo twanet, nai eŋopiyari atwanare aneni kec.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekwaan emaase ka ŋaŋolei ŋuna etenito aŋuna ke ejiye; ayakasi nakyes kec ŋiboorei ŋulu ikwaan ka ŋibokoi ŋulu itiyaunitae a egolid, ekwaan ŋireetin kec ka ŋulu a ŋituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekwaan ŋitim kec ka ŋulu a ŋaberu, ekwaan ŋikyal kec ka ŋulu a ŋiŋatunyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arapap ŋatorobwo kec a ŋarapeta a ŋuna etiyaunitae a ŋasuwa, eruye ŋolo a ŋabebenuk kec ekwaan ka eruye ŋolo a ŋagaari a ŋuna irito ŋaŋolei a ŋuna emaryaara lojiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyakatar ikes ŋiladoi ŋulu pesyet ŋulu ikwaan ka ŋulu a ŋikiitwania, loladoi kec iŋes eyai agogoŋu ŋina wanet ŋituŋa ŋilapyo ŋikan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyakatar ikes erwosit ŋolo ipukat ikes ŋolo erae emalaika ŋolo epolokinit auwuat ŋina aoyan ŋina nyesalunit alokwap. Enyaritae ekeekiro a Ŋaburaniyae Abadon; a Ŋagirik enyaritae Apolyon (akeepolou iŋes atemar “Ekenyasunan.”)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alunyarosi ŋican ŋulu esyaunak, nai eponito nabo ŋiarei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Arupepe ŋina a ŋakanikapei",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu emalaika ŋolo a ŋikanikapei tokutak arupepe keŋ. Abu eira etoil ebunit a Namuroet, alowaetin a ŋuluomwon, a ŋulu ikote ŋamomwar. Etiyaunitae Namuroet a egolid ka eyai kiŋaren Akuj. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tolimok etoil ŋol emalaika ŋolo a ŋikanikapei ŋolo ayakar arupepe tema, “Tolacak ŋimalaikan ŋuluomwon ŋulu eenitae anaŋolol a ŋina apolon a ŋina enyaritae Eupurate.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi tolacakinae ŋimalaikan ŋuluomwon ŋulu etemokinitoe aŋuna a esaa a ŋol ka akoloŋit a ŋin, ka aŋuna a elap a ŋol ka aŋuna a ekaru a ŋol, akiar atutubet apei alotooma ŋunauni ŋuna a ŋituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aponi okolimokin ayoŋ ekimar ŋolo a ŋituŋa a ŋulu etemokinitoe aŋuna ke ejiye: arae ikes ŋamilyonin ŋamiae ŋaarei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anakiruja kaŋ, abu oanyuwa ŋaŋolei ka ŋikametok kec alopite a lo: anapito ŋikametok ŋarapeta ŋuna areŋak ikwa akim, topusiyaka ikwa ebuulu ka tonyaŋaaka ikwa Sulpa. Ekote ŋakyes ŋuna a ŋaŋolei a ŋun ŋuna a ŋiŋatunyo, alomunit akim, apuru ka Sulpa anakituka kec. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu ŋakisicaneta ŋunauni nu: akim, apuru ka Sulpa, ŋuna alomunito anakituka a ŋaŋolei, toara atutubet apei alotooma ŋunauni ŋuna a ŋituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anerae eyai agogoŋu ŋina a ŋaŋolei nakituka kec ka loladoi. Ikote ŋiladoi kec ŋimuno a ŋuna eyakatar ŋakyes ŋuna ewanawanaata ŋituŋa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŋituŋa ŋulu pa apotu ŋakisicaneta ŋun toara, apotu nyekiwa akilip neni a ŋipyan ka neni a ŋakujo a ŋuna etiyaunito ikes ŋilopeyek. Etiyaunitae ŋakujo ŋun a egolid, a esilipa, a eburonis, a ŋamoru ka a ŋakito; ŋakujo ŋuna nyepedorete aanyuwar, akiirar, kori alosit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apotu daŋ ŋituŋa nyekiwa akiar, akikukuja, amalao, kori akoko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
